# The web panel needs no environment variables.
# It calls the API on its own origin (/api/v1): the panel's nginx proxies it to
# the control plane and adds the API key from NOVUSGATE_API_KEY (docker compose
# passes API_KEY from server/deployments/docker/.env); in development the Vite
# dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:8080.
# VITE_API_URL and VITE_API_KEY are no longer read.
# VITE_WS_URL is read only by the useWebSocket hook, which nothing uses (the
# server has no WebSocket route); leave it unset.
